// # openOODA CLI Examples — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Sample scripts that exercise the cli/ driver end-to-end.
//
// Setup: Each example is a runnable shell command or .oo snippet. They double as smoke tests.
//
// Beats:
//   1. hello_cli.oo — minimal `cli --help` smoke test.
//   2. install_to_tmp.oo — install to a /tmp prefix and verify the binary exists.
//   3. fix_safe_mode.oo — `cli fix --dry-run` on a known-broken file.
//
// Examples land as sibling files. Do not import missing placeholders.
